      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MANAVENDRA (3) finally gets out to a more suitable trip for him here and can improve again. He disappointed last start at Carnarvon, but was solid in Saturday grade prior. He can bounce back to his best form here in what looks a suitable race. DESERT EDGE (5) won narrowly two back before a 1.8L defeat at Northam most recently. Gray hops on board now and he has enough early speed to offset a tricky draw. Wouldn't surprise to see him back to winning ways. LET'S SEA (8) won well two back before a 3.9L defeat most recently at Carnarvon. A better draw this time should help his chances and getting out in trip now should suit. Can feature in the finish. ZADAR ROCK (1) was too good last time out and can continue his winning ways without surprising. REGINALD (2) is better than he showed last time out and can bounce back to his best.",
